'''Marcus Thornton''' (born [[June 5]], [[1987]] in [[Baton Rouge, LA]]) is a [[basketball]] player who currently plays for the [[LSU Tigers basketball|LSU Tigers]].  He is the [[SEC Men's Basketball Player of the Year|2009 SEC Men's Basketball Player of the Year]]. Thornton is considered an early second-round NBA draft prospect.

